UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Rock Thai Sushi Steenberg is a Thai and sushi restaurant in Steenberg Village, Tokai, serving a menu built around Thai, seafood, sushi and vegetarian dishes for guests who want more variety than a single-cuisine menu usually offers. Diners can eat in, collect a takeaway order, or have food delivered, making it a flexible option for a sit-down meal or a quick weeknight dinner.

